{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"point\":1,\"extracted\":\"gnews:085b1e1a1543437edb9756d6#e6\",\"why\":\"Sharon AI disclosed a $4.88 billion backstop for its Australian AI factory.\"}\n{\"point\":2,\"extracted\":\"gnews:085b1e1a1543437edb9756d6#e7\",\"why\":\"Firmus announced a 360 MW AI cluster in Batam under an Nvidia backstop.\"}\n{\"point\":3,\"extracted\":\"gnews:085b1e1a1543437edb9756d6#e7\",\"why\":\"Firmus expected $25 billion to $30 billion in customer revenue over six years.\"}\n{\"point\":4,\"extracted\":\"none\",\"why\":\"No kept item states that additional backstops are undisclosed, many neoclouds are negotiating, or announcements are expected to accelerate.\"}\n{\"point\":5,\"extracted\":\"gnews:4d1677af37befd53ca3e7b45#ev4\",\"why\":\"Nvidia was reportedly negotiating to guarantee OpenAI's Ohio data center lease.\"}\n{\"point\":6,\"extracted\":\"gnews:f8191f5bb960d79e47c73d6c#e1\",\"why\":\"The first matching item states the big four hyperscalers planned about $650 billion in data center spending in 2026; the next item states Nvidia's forecast of over $1 trillion in 2027.\"}\n{\"point\":7,\"extracted\":\"gnews:92c7e54d38dc2916aa185568#ev-3\",\"why\":\"Wall Street analysts projected Nvidia revenue growth of 82% this year and 41% next year.\"}\n{\"point\":8,\"extracted\":\"gnews:3df0bbc8aff2c1d008bc0a32#ev-dc-memory-share\",\"why\":\"Some estimates put memory at half of data center spending in 2027.\"}\n{\"point\":9,\"extracted\":\"gnews:54aa9ce326115cedf8857512#ev-4\",\"why\":\"Goldman Sachs estimated AI infrastructure spending could reach $765 billion in 2026 and $1.6 trillion in 2031.\"}\n{\"point\":10,\"extracted\":\"gnews:552f8c2bdfd080555d592587#E1\",\"why\":\"SemiAnalysis reported that Kyber NVL144 was delayed to 2028 because the PCB midplane was difficult to manufacture.\"}\n{\"point\":11,\"extracted\":\"gnews:795ea94e1100415a67fd1a96#ev-3\",\"why\":\"The reported four-die Rubin Ultra was canceled, leaving a two-die version with roughly half the compute performance.\"}\n{\"point\":12,\"extracted\":\"gnews:795ea94e1100415a67fd1a96#ev-4\",\"why\":\"Nvidia reportedly planned to sell more existing-form Oberon-Rubin racks to make up for the shortfall.\"}\n{\"point\":13,\"extracted\":\"gnews:552f8c2bdfd080555d592587#E5\",\"why\":\"Nvidia rejected the delay report and said its roadmap was intact.\"}\n{\"point\":14,\"extracted\":\"gnews:c75f16a6d64cc27fc28fb571#ev-5\",\"why\":\"An Nvidia representative said the roadmap was intact, though the outlet said the intended roadmap was unclear.\"}\n{\"point\":15,\"extracted\":\"gnews:4d1677af37befd53ca3e7b45#ev6\",\"why\":\"Nvidia added $3.5 billion in customer data center lease guarantees in exchange for rights to purchase shares.\"}\n{\"point\":16,\"extracted\":\"gnews:085b1e1a1543437edb9756d6#e4\",\"why\":\"Nvidia had started backstopping data center leases for neoclouds.\"}"}}
